  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support: Development of Regional Solid Waste Landfill, where Sida supports elaboration of regional waste management plan, plan for closure of old landfills and a public awareness campaign. Implemented by EBRD.It is part of 16MEUR support to construction of landfill and transfer stations and establishing regional waste management system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r uppbyggnad av en regional sophanteringsanl&#xe4;ggning/soptipp, d&#xe4;r Sida finansierar det tekniska st&#xf6;det och EBRD investeringsbehoven med en kredit. Totalt omfattar den regionala so&#xe5;ptippen nio kommuner</narrative>
  </description>
